# Silver-Fur Master: "Other Ninja and Rogue creatures you control get +1/+1" (CR 613.4c). Bot1 controls the Master (a Ninja,
# 2/2, left out by "other"), Fang of Shigeki (a Ninja only, 1/1 -> 2/2) and Robber of the Rich (a Rogue only, 2/2 -> 3/3), so
# each of the two types pumps on its own. Bot2's own Robber of the Rich stays 2/2: only creatures its controller controls.
# All of Bot1's creatures come in on turn 1 off Moxen and a Black Lotus (red, for Robber's {1}{R}); Bot2's on turn 2.

